WEBVTT

00:00:58.246 --> 00:01:01.412
So first I want you to focus
on your fixed expenses.

00:01:01.454 --> 00:01:03.871
Take the day to evaluate your bills.

00:01:03.871 --> 00:01:06.079
Can you truly afford your housing payment?

00:01:06.121 --> 00:01:08.413
Is it time to start looking
for a cheaper place?

00:01:08.454 --> 00:01:11.163
Do you need to switch
to a low-cost cell phone provider?

00:01:11.204 --> 00:01:14.079
Do you need to trade in your car
for something else?

00:01:14.079 --> 00:01:16.788
This is the day where
I really want you to think about

00:01:16.788 --> 00:01:18.413
those large fixed expenses

00:01:18.413 --> 00:01:20.288
and make that one-time change.

00:01:20.288 --> 00:01:24.246
Number two: sign up for the
boring-but-necessary stuff.

00:01:24.246 --> 00:01:25.621
Do you have life insurance?

00:01:25.621 --> 00:01:26.913
No? Sign up now.

00:01:26.954 --> 00:01:29.246
Are you enrolled in your company's 401(k)?

00:01:29.246 --> 00:01:30.579
No? Sign up now.